.TH ROX-FIND 1 "September 2026" "Rox-Filer2 2.12.2-89" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rox-find \- search files from Rox-Filer2
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rox-find
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ path ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
rox-find is the native search companion used by Rox-Filer2. It provides file
name and content search integrated with the file manager.
.SH OPTIONS
Run
.B rox-find --help
for the options supported by the installed version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rox (1)
